flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Upload[User Uploads MRI Scan]
    Upload --> Valid{File Valid?}
    Valid -- No --> Error[Show Error Message]
    Error --> End([End])
    Valid -- Yes --> Preprocess[Preprocess Scaling & Normalization]
    
    Preprocess --> Split
    subgraph Parallel[Parallel Processing]
        Split{Split} --> AI[CNN Disease Prediction]
        Split --> Tumor[Tumor Localization]
        Split --> Conn[Generate Connectome]
        Split --> Sim[Run Jansen-Rit Simulation]
    end
    
    AI --> Join
    Tumor --> Join
    Conn --> Join
    Sim --> Join
    
    Join{Join} --> Consolidate[Consolidate Results]
    Consolidate --> Render[Render 3D Brain Viewer]
    Render --> Report[Generate Dashboard Report]
    Report --> End
